---
---
<section class="philosophy dark-section section">
  <span class="philosophy-mark" aria-hidden="true">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 200 200" width="100%" height="100%">
      <circle cx="100" cy="100" r="98" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="0.6" fill="none" opacity="0.4"/>
      <text x="100" y="135" text-anchor="middle"
            font-family="Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif"
            font-size="120" font-style="italic" fill="currentColor" opacity="0.85">D</text>
    </svg>
  </span>

  <div class="container philosophy-grid">
    <div class="philosophy-head reveal">
      <p class="eyebrow on-dark">Philosophy</p>
      <h2>The art is in <em>what you don't see</em>.</h2>
      <span class="ph-rule" aria-hidden="true"></span>
    </div>
    <div class="philosophy-body reveal">
      <p class="lead">Twenty years of training — across Harvard, Brown, Tufts, and the Beverly Hills Institute of Plastic Surgery — informs an approach that prizes proportion over alteration. The most successful surgery is the one that goes unnoticed.</p>
      <p class="lead">Dr. Desai's published research on craniofacial reconstruction, his international cleft-lip mission work, and his extensive media-recognized expertise in revision surgery have all shaped a singular surgical eye: one trained equally on art and anatomy.</p>
      <a href="/about" class="btn btn-ghost">The full story <span class="arrow">→</span></a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .philosophy { position: relative; overflow: hidden; }
  .philosophy-mark {
    position: absolute;
    right: clamp(-60px, -6vw, -20px);
    top: 50%;
    transform: translateY(-50%);
    width: clamp(300px, 36vw, 540px);
    aspect-ratio: 1;
    color: var(--mauve-deep);
    opacity: 0.18;
    pointer-events: none;
    z-index: 0;
  }
  .philosophy-grid {
    position: relative; z-index: 1;
    display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.3fr;
    gap: clamp(40px, 8vw, 96px);
    align-items: start;
  }
  .philosophy-head { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 24px; align-items: flex-start; }
  .philosophy-head h2 {
    font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 5vw, 4.5rem);
    font-weight: 260; letter-spacing: -0.04em;
    line-height: 1.02;
    max-width: 14ch;
  }
  .philosophy h2 em {
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--accent-on-inverse);
    font-weight: 280;
    letter-spacing: -0.045em;
  }
  .ph-rule {
    display: block; width: 64px; height: 1px;
    background: var(--accent-on-inverse);
    opacity: 0.7;
  }
  .philosophy-body { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 24px; align-items: flex-start; }
  @media (max-width: 800px) {
    .philosophy-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .philosophy-mark { right: -25%; opacity: 0.12; }
  }
</style>
